<!-- ======================== THE GAP ======================== -->
<section class="section" id="gap">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="kicker">The orchestration gap</p>
      <h2 class="big-head">Agents are everywhere.<br>Orchestration is missing.</h2>
      <p class="lead-muted">Teams ship capable agents and then watch them stall. The gaps between agents become someone's job — tracked in Slack threads, handed off by copy-paste, invisible to anyone outside the room.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="gap2" id="gaps"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ======================== WHAT IT IS ======================== -->
<section class="section charcoal" id="what">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="witis">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">How we fill the gap</p>
        <h2 class="big-head">One surface that decides, assigns,<br>and enforces — end to end.</h2>
        <p class="lead-muted">Aixle Flow sits between your agents and your team. It decides what runs next, routes it to the right worker — agent or person — enforces your policy at every handoff, and carries the work all the way through without anyone holding it by hand.</p>
        <div class="flist" id="feats"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="gap-vis reveal">
        <div class="gap-stage" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 460 360" class="gap-svg">
            <!-- incoming task -->
            <rect class="gap-card" x="175" y="20" width="110" height="42" rx="12"/>
            <text class="gap-task" x="230" y="46">Incoming task</text>
            <path class="gap-wire" d="M230 62 L230 112"/>

            <!-- curved spokes from the governor to each worker -->
            <path class="gap-wire" d="M230 190 C180 240 92 232 92 288"/>
            <path class="gap-wire" d="M230 190 L230 288"/>
            <path class="gap-wire" d="M230 190 C280 240 368 232 368 288"/>

            <!-- the work moves behind the cards: task -> flow -> agent1 -> flow -> reviewer -> flow -> publish -->
            <circle class="gap-token" r="4.5">
