      <h2 class="big-head">Flow lives inside Execute — between what you plan and what you learn.</h2>
      <p class="lead-muted">The Aixle platform covers the full lifecycle of agent work: Plan defines it, Execute runs it, Evolve improves it. Flow is the Execute layer — the part that actually moves work through the system, step by step, with every decision logged and every handoff governed.</p>
