        <h2 class="big-head">Runs entirely in your own Docker.</h2>
        <p class="lead-muted">No extra runtimes on your host — everything runs in containers. Two commands bring up the board, the workflow engine, and four agent runtimes. Code and credentials never leave your infrastructure. The managed platform on aixle.com is there if you want it, never required.</p>
        <div class="kpis">
          <div class="kpi"><div class="v">2</div><div class="l">commands to a running instance</div></div>
          <div class="kpi"><div class="v">0</div><div class="l">host runtimes — Docker and git, that's it</div></div>
